cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the archived release and the manuscript."
title: "S2-LithoBench: a reproducible benchmark for validation-aware lithological mapping with Sentinel-2 in arid terrains"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data for a reproducible benchmark that compares random and
  spatially blocked validation for Sentinel-2 lithological mapping in two arid
  Australian regions, including feature ablations (bands, indices, terrain,
  texture), five classifiers, a cross-region transfer test, trained-model
  recipes, figures and analysis scripts.
type: software
